          }
        },
        "text_M4z3WF": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Collection cups connect directly to compatible breast pumps via tubing, replacing traditional external bottles with a more compact in-bra collection setup. Once attached, the cups sit securely inside your bra, allowing discreet milk collection.</p><p>As the pump creates suction, milk flows into the cup, where it is stored until the session is complete. A built-in pour spout allows for easy transfer into milk storage containers or bags after pumping.</p><p>This setup simplifies milk collection and reduces the need to handle multiple components during your routine.</p>",
            "enlarge_text": false
          }
        }
