        "text_jHq6dp": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Collection cups offer a more flexible approach to pumping compared to traditional setups.</p><ul><li>Hands-free design allows for more mobility</li><li>Reduces the need to hold bottles during pumping</li><li>Supports discreet pumping in different environments</li><li>Simplifies milk collection and transfer</li><li>Helps maintain a consistent routine across pumping sessions</li></ul>",
