        "text_TrVJFe": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>To maintain performance, hygiene, and safety, sterilize all parts before and after each use.</p><ul><li>Fully disassemble all components before cleaning</li><li>Wash with warm water and mild dish soap</li><li>Rinse thoroughly and allow to air dry</li><li>Top rack dishwasher safe</li><li>Suitable for boiling water sanitization for up to 10 minutes</li><li>Compatible with CleanEase steam sanitization bags</li></ul>",
